ZigFall is the developer blog and devlog for an Open Source 2D Platformer Game written in Zig.

# About Devlogs

Devlogs are published weekly containing news about the ongoing development progress.

# Blog

Blogs are published occasionally about a certain topic of interest regarding the development of the game.
It will be mostly educational content about how we can possibly engineer a 2D Platformer game.